abstract = {This article aims to explore an innovative method for cultural and creative product design that combines genetic algorithms with artificial intelligence image generation technology. Based on the cultural relics collected by the Shandong Provincial Museum, taking the design of a cultural and creative pillow as an example, the key design parameters of the pillow were optimized through genetic algorithm. The optimal parameter combination was transformed into AI image generation prompts, generating multiple design drawings. Professional personnel then evaluated and scored the design drawings to determine the best design solution. This method provides an efficient, precise, and creative approach for the design of cultural and creative products, which is expected to promote the development of the cultural and creative industry.},
